  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Halvtids&#xf6;versyn CNVP FLED</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid Term Review MTR CNVP FLED</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Halvtids&#xf6;versyn av FLED i enlighet med avtal med CNVP. Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att bed&#xf6;ma projektets resultat, effektivitet och kostnadseffektivitet, samt att f&#xe5; rekommendationer p&#xe5; ev f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar av m&#xe5;l, finansiering och genomf&#xf6;rande f&#xf6;r att ytterligare f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra insatsen. Genomlysningen ska ocks&#xe5; dokumentera erfarenheter och l&#xe4;rdomar vilka kan st&#xf6;dja utveckling av sektorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid-term Review of FLED in accordance with agreement with CNVP. The objective of the review is to assess the performance of the project (its efficiency and effectiveness) and to provide if appropriate, comments in regards to any required changes, e g in regards to the project scope objectives, duration, financing, and management arrangements.
 
The review should further document lessons learned from the implementation of the various project interventions for informing future sector development.</narrative>
  </description>
